; Base Z: 2.50 mm
; Wall top Z: 14.50 mm
; Radius: 26.0 mm  (diameter 52.0 mm)
; Center: (100, 100)
; Print speed: 500 mm/min
; Extrusion mult: 0.035
; Single fill layer at Z=4.50 mm inside the cup

